From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 16:58:04 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Collect all the rotated log files, not only the first 19
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"

The tests added in the previous commit now pass. They check which
rotated files are collected, but not in which order. A unit test of
the new get_rotated_logs() checks that the rotated files are sorted by
rotation number, then by log, and that the verbosity limits their
number.

Signed-off-by: Seb Hinderer <sebastien.hinderer@vates.tech>
